    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d956">

                <pb facs="0920" n="822" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg822"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Merry.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-15"><hi rendition="#italic">August 15,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 356.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: On the 8th instant I sent you the following
                        telegram.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d956-f1"/></p>
                <p>The instruction referred to is No. 352 of the 2d instant. I inclose herewith for
                    your information a copy of a telegram,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d956-f2"/> dated the
                    7th instant, from Minister Corea, on which the telegram to you was based,
                    together with a copy of my note<anchor n="1" xml:id="d956-f3"/> to him in
                    reply.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
